# `space.add`

Register a directory as a space (ensures its .ship/ exists).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.space.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `path` | `string` |
| `name` | `string` |

## Returns

`Space` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `path` | `string` |
| `name` | `string` |
| `created_at` | `string` |
| `last_seen_at` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call space.add --json '{ "path": "", "name": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "harbor",
  "path": "/home/dev/harbor",
  "name": "Harbor",
  "created_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "last_seen_at": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z"
}
```
